\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>91.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caves\" title=\"Caves\"><img alt=\"Stage Caves icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Caves icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Caves_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1a/Stage_Caves_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072901\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flooded_Caves\" title=\"Flooded Caves\"><img alt=\"Stage Flooded Caves icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Flooded Caves icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Flooded_Caves_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/ef/Stage_Flooded_Caves_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073202\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Depths\" title=\"Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/7b/Stage_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073002\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necropolis\" title=\"Necropolis\"><img alt=\"Stage Necropolis icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Necropolis icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Necropolis_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2d/Stage_Necropolis_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073022\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dank_Depths\" title=\"Dank Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Dank Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dank Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073222\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sheol\" title=\"Sheol\"><img alt=\"Stage Sheol icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Sheol icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Sheol_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/71/Stage_Sheol_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073042\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Room\" title=\"Dark Room\"><img alt=\"Stage Dark Room icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dark Room icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/60/Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072941\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Room\" title=\"Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Swarmers</b> float aimlessly around the room, occasionally spawning &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly#Attack_Fly\" title=\"Fly\"><img alt=\"Attack Fly\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Attack Fly.png\" data-image-key=\"Attack_Fly.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/c5/Attack_Fly.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821090144\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fly#Attack_Fly\" title=\"Fly\">Attack Flies</a>. When hit, they will spawn a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pooter\" title=\"Pooter\"><img alt=\"Pooter\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Pooter.png\" data-image-key=\"Pooter.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/26/Pooter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825021112\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pooter\" title=\"Pooter\">Pooter</a>, and when destroyed, they will spawn a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boom_Fly\" title=\"Boom Fly\"><img alt=\"Boom Fly\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boom Fly.png\" data-image-key=\"Boom_Fly.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b2/Boom_Fly.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20210821091339\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Boom_Fly\" title=\"Boom Fly\">Boom Fly</a>. Swarmers do not deal contact damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Skatole&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Skatole\" title=\"Skatole\"><img alt=\"Collectible Skatole icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Skatole icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Skatole_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/58/Collectible_Skatole_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821043936\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Skatole\" title=\"Skatole\">Skatole</a></span> will charm a Swarmer. When charmed it won't spawn any Attack Flies until it is damaged. The Attack Flies that spawn will also be charmed.</li>\n<li>The ring of Flies that surround the Swarmer is an indication of how much health it has. The Flies deplete as the Swarmer takes more damage.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Swarmers are the next and possibly the final stage of the original &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gaper\" title=\"Gaper\"><img alt=\"Gaper\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gaper.png\" data-image-key=\"Gaper.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/3b/Gaper.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20210821090455\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gaper\" title=\"Gaper\">Gaper</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>As Swarmers have Champion forms it's possible to encounter a White Champion (though extremely rarely). This can be a challenging occurrence as the Swarmer will regain invincibility every time it takes damage due to spawning Pooters.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://edmundmcmillen.tumblr.com/post/51416553970/binding-of-isaac-fast-facts-now-they-need-to-do\">https://edmundmcmillen.tumblr.com/post/51416553970/binding-of-isaac-fast-facts-now-they-need-to-do</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no